wal</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134982648,imgsize-81086.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[‘The name is George Soros’: American singer Mary Millben alleges US funding behind Delhi protests against CEC]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/the-name-is-george-soros-american-singer-mary-millben-alleges-us-funding-behind-delhi-protests-against-cec/articleshow/134982560.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134982560.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[Mary Millben alleges that billionaire George Soros is financially backing protests in India with the intention of undermining Prime Minister Modi's government. She urges young Indians to stand with Modi to actively challenge what she deems as disruptive protests. Millben also criticizes Rahul Gandhi of Congress and Abhijeet Dipke of the Cockroach Janta Party for their involvement, while emphasizing that having clear objectives is crucial for impactful change.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/the-name-is-george-soros-american-singer-mary-millben-alleges-us-funding-behind-delhi-protests-against-cec/articleshow/134982560.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/the-name-is-george-soros-american-singer-mary-millben-alleges-us-funding-behind-delhi-protests-against-cec/articleshow/134982560.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-16T10:10:55+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Aryan Singh</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134982607,imgsize-91136.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[ICMR picks 7 centres to develop priority medical devices, diagnostics]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/icmr-picks-7-centres-to-develop-priority-medical-devices-diagnostics/articleshow